WEBVTT

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:02.360
We were invaded by the Shroud.

00:00:02.360 --> 00:00:04.240
Some sort of shadow monsters.

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:09.120
Oh boy.

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:14.880
We are seeing coordinated attacks, battle formations.

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:17.920
The Shroud are getting smarter and scarier.

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:19.360
Are the Shroud evolving?

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:23.482
We will need more pandemonium if we expect to continue our

00:00:23.482 --> 00:00:24.880
fight against the Shroud.

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:28.680
But without Jimmy's lab, we cannot make more and we are

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:29.440
nearly out.

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:32.183
I need you to figure out how and why the Shroud is suddenly

00:00:32.183 --> 00:00:32.880
acting strange.

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:34.240
And get the lab up and running.

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:38.560
Team, on my mark. Alpha formation.

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:39.440
Alpha? What?

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:40.480
Did I miss something?

00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:43.440
That's embarrassing. You dudes are a mess.

00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:44.800
I've never seen a number like it.

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:47.840
It's detected more pandemonium than the lab ever produced.

00:00:47.840 --> 00:00:48.720
Problem solved.

00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:51.957
The signature's alt. It almost feels like there's something

00:00:51.957 --> 00:00:52.560
else there.

00:00:52.560 --> 00:00:55.120
Whatever it is, we need to get there before the Shroud.

00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:57.805
Using this, I can get to the particles before Jimmy's

00:00:57.805 --> 00:00:58.160
Beasts.

00:00:58.160 --> 00:00:59.920
Just give me another chance.

00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:02.480
One last chance, Shadow Coil.

00:01:02.480 --> 00:01:04.160
You will not fail again.

00:01:07.680 --> 00:01:08.800
Panther, help!

00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:13.120
Stay strong, because I'm going to save you.

00:01:13.120 --> 00:01:14.640
And I'm going to bring you home.

00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:16.480
And it's going to be just like it used to be.

00:01:16.480 --> 00:01:17.840
Oh, except she's here too.

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:19.280
How often do you talk to yourself?

00:01:19.280 --> 00:01:23.840
Panther, keep the team ready for the battles ahead.

00:01:24.480 --> 00:01:25.920
I'm counting on you.
